{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ep83K3vH9fBm6EEXAe4K54","type":"tool_result","content":"paper_framing.md:40:[Omitted long matching line]\npaper_framing.md:240:7. **\"Where are the downstream task results?\"** → ✅ DONE (plan_012 + W3, all 5 models): Qwen (Spread): +1.25 to +4.00pp across 4 tasks, 72.8% avg recovery. Yi-1.5 (Spike): avg -0.77pp. Llama (Spike): avg -0.99pp (0/5 tasks positive — systematic). Mistral (Flat): avg -0.48pp. Gemma-2 (Flat): avg +0.14pp (noise). **Diagnostic predicts both PPL and downstream correctly across all 5 architectures**. Must report full per-task tables; use \"shows minor degradation\" not \"preserves accuracy\".\ndecisions.yaml:632:  rationale: Qwen2.5-72B ~144GB bf16 无法单卡加载，需要 2 GPU。但只增加 Qwen 家族一个数据点，对 n=3 架构分析的泛化性帮助有限。11\ndecisions.yaml:691:  rationale: Qwen2.5-72B 需 144GB 磁盘，服务器最多可用 ~120GB（清理后）。Gemma-2-9B 已在跑且 Significance\ndecisions.yaml:857:  summary: 审稿响应：修正 W1 新模型选择为 Qwen2.5-14B + Phi-3-medium + Falcon-7B\ndecisions.yaml:858:  rationale: Reviewer 审查指出原选择（Mistral-Nemo, Llama-3.2）与已有模型同家族，不增加信息。Qwen2.5-14B 战略性验证\ndecisions.yaml:878:    已派单执行 LaTeX 集成。如 Qwen2.5-14B 确认 Spread → 可升级为 empirical diagnostic (N=2)。\nROADMAP.md:3:> 最后更新: 2026-05-15 08:27 UTC | 更新原因: GPU满载(Gemma-2 BOS + Qwen2.5-14B profiling) + Reviewer framing双重确认 + Paper Agent已启动\nROADMAP.md:20:- [ ] **W1**: Qwen2.5-14B profiling RUNNING (cuda:1, ~3h) + OPT-6.7B 待下载\nROADMAP.md:48:- cuda:1 → **Qwen2.5-14B W1 hires profiling** (100% util, 33GB, ~3h, 384 heads)\nROADMAP.md:53:- [ ] Qwen2.5-14B profiling完成 → concentration分析 → 如Spread则完整pipeline\nROADMAP.md:60:- Day 0-1: W1 Qwen2.5-14B + OPT profiling + Gemma-2 constrained\nROADMAP.md:68:剩余: Qwen2.5-14B full pipeline (~6-8h) + OPT profiling (~2h) + Gemma-2 constrained (~0.25h)\nROADMAP.md:75:| D052 | 2026-05-15 | 审稿响应：修正 W1 新模型选择为 Qwen2.5-14B + Phi-3-medium + Fal | w2_unconstrained_baselines, w9_compounding_scaling |\nartifacts/review_issues.yaml:14:      action: \"Qwen2.5-14B hires profiling for N>1 Spread validation (download complete, profiling dispatched cuda:1)\"\nartifacts/review_issues.yaml:91:      action: \"Qwen2.5-14B profiling to check if Spread is Qwen family trait (dispatched)\"\nartifacts/spike_vs_spread_literature.md:16:- **Results**: On Qwen3-8B at 2.5 bits, reduces KIVI PPL from 49.3 to 14.9 (70% reduction). On TurboQuant at 4.0 bits, recovers 66% of quantization-induced degradation.\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/paper_framing.md:40:[Omitted long matching line]\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/paper_framing.md:240:7. **\"Where are the downstream task results?\"** → ✅ DONE (plan_012 + W3, all 5 models): Qwen (Spread): +1.25 to +4.00pp across 4 tasks, 72.8% avg recovery. Yi-1.5 (Spike): avg -0.77pp. Llama (Spike): avg -0.99pp (0/5 tasks positive — systematic). Mistral (Flat): avg -0.48pp. Gemma-2 (Flat): avg +0.14pp (noise). **Diagnostic predicts both PPL and downstream correctly across all 5 architectures**. Must report full per-task tables; use \"shows minor degradation\" not \"preserves accuracy\".\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:2:narrative_guidance: '原始 framing 完全成立。Qwen2.5-14B 确认 Spread pattern (N=2)，Claim 3 措辞从\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:5:  可形式化为 proposition。 5→6 model downstream 表加 14B 第六行，Spread 类别有两个正面样本。 论文以 \"systematic\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:10:- name: Qwen2.5-14B hires bf16 2-bit-only profiling\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:14:    14B 是否保持 Spread pattern。\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:18:    model: Qwen2.5-14B\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/best/imagined_experiments.yaml:46:  result_rationale: 'Qwen2.5-14B 与 7B 同属 Qwen2.5 架构族，共享相同的 attention 设计（GQA、 RoPE、SwiGLU）。7B\nartifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T085855/